---
// Gateway request path. Labels are short and identical in both languages except the captions.
---
<figure class="arch arch-scroll" role="img" aria-labelledby="ag-t" data-aria-en="Gateway architecture diagram" data-aria-zh="网关架构图">
  <span id="ag-t" class="sr"><span data-l="en">Request path: clients send OpenAI Responses, Chat Completions or Anthropic Messages requests. The gateway authenticates the key, decodes into a typed internal format (URP), runs transforms, routes through an ordered provider waterfall with retries and circuit breakers, encodes to the upstream format, streams the reply back in the client’s format, and records usage. A React console and Prometheus metrics are served by the same binary.</span><span data-l="zh">请求路径：客户端发来 OpenAI Responses、Chat Completions 或 Anthropic Messages 请求。网关校验密钥，解码成带类型的内部格式（URP），执行变换，按顺序瀑布式路由（重试和熔断），编码成上游格式，再按客户端的格式流式返回，并记录用量。React 控制台和 Prometheus 指标由同一个程序提供。</span></span>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1100 470" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs><marker id="ag-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.5)"/></marker></defs>
    <g>
      <rect class="box" x="10" y="40" width="190" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="26" y="68">/v1/responses</text><text class="sub" x="26" y="88">HTTP · SSE · WebSocket</text>
      <rect class="box" x="10" y="122" width="190" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="26" y="150">/v1/chat/completions</text><text class="sub" x="26" y="170">OpenAI-compatible</text>
      <rect class="box" x="10" y="204" width="190" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="26" y="232">/v1/messages</text><text class="sub" x="26" y="252">Anthropic-compatible</text>
      <rect class="box" x="10" y="286" width="190" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="26" y="314">embeddings · images</text><text class="sub" x="26" y="334">models · compact</text>
    </g>
    <rect class="box hi" x="250" y="30" width="600" height="330" rx="22" style="fill:#0f1415"/>
    <text class="sub" x="272" y="58">ONE RUST BINARY · axum + tokio</text>
    <g>
      <rect class="box" x="272" y="78" width="120" height="70" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="288" y="108">API key</text><text class="sub" x="288" y="128">auth · quota</text>
      <rect class="box hi" x="412" y="78" width="130" height="70" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="428" y="108">Decode → URP</text><text class="sub" x="428" y="128">typed items</text>
      <rect class="box" x="562" y="78" width="130" height="70" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="578" y="108">Transforms</text><text class="sub" x="578" y="128">43 modules</text>
      <rect class="box hi" x="712" y="78" width="120" height="70" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="728" y="108">Router</text><text class="sub" x="728" y="128">waterfall</text>
      <path class="flow hi" d="M392 113H410M542 113H560M692 113H710" marker-end="url(#ag-a)"/>
      <rect class="box" x="272" y="176" width="270" height="76" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="288" y="206">Stream back in client format</text><text class="sub" x="288" y="226">event lifecycle kept intact</text>
      <rect class="box" x="562" y="176" width="270" height="76" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="578" y="206">Health &amp; retries</text><text class="sub" x="578" y="226">circuit breakers · probes · cooldowns</text>
      <rect class="box am" x="272" y="270" width="270" height="72" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="288" y="300">Usage accounting</text><text class="sub" x="288" y="320">integer units · one rounding</text>
      <rect class="box" x="562" y="270" width="270" height="72" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="578" y="300">Capture &amp; logs</text><text class="sub" x="578" y="320">request · response · timings</text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <rect class="box" x="900" y="40" width="190" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="916" y="68">responses</text><text class="sub" x="916" y="88">upstream channel</text>
      <rect class="box" x="900" y="122" width="190" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="916" y="150">chat_completion</text><text class="sub" x="916" y="170">upstream channel</text>
      <rect class="box" x="900" y="204" width="190" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="916" y="232">messages · gemini</text><text class="sub" x="916" y="252">upstream channels</text>
      <rect class="box" x="900" y="286" width="190" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="916" y="314">image · video</text><text class="sub" x="916" y="334">upstream channels</text>
    </g>
    <path class="flow" d="M200 72C230 72 230 113 270 113M200 154C230 154 230 113 270 113M200 236C230 236 230 113 270 113M200 318C230 318 230 113 270 113" marker-end="url(#ag-a)"/>
    <path class="flow hi" d="M832 113C866 113 866 72 898 72M832 113C866 113 866 154 898 154M832 113C866 113 866 236 898 236M832 113C866 113 866 318 898 318"/>
    <rect class="box" x="250" y="390" width="290" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="268" y="418">React console</text><text class="sub" x="268" y="438">embedded at build time · 4 locales</text>
    <rect class="box" x="560" y="390" width="290" height="64" rx="14"/><text class="lbl" x="578" y="418">PostgreSQL</text><text class="sub" x="578" y="438">SeaORM · migrations · /metrics</text>
    <path class="flow" d="M395 360V388M705 360V388"/>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="arch-legend"><span style="color:var(--teal)">━ <span data-l="en">request path</span><span data-l="zh">请求路径</span></span><span style="color:var(--amber)">━ <span data-l="en">accounting</span><span data-l="zh">用量统计</span></span><span><span data-l="en">Fallback stops after the first byte reaches the client, so a stream never switches upstream midway.</span><span data-l="zh">第一个字节发给客户端之后就不再切换上游，流不会中途换线。</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
